<div class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 px-4 py-8 text-slate-800 md:px-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-lg">
    <a href="/doses/hoje" class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 transition hover:text-slate-800">
      <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6" /></svg>
      Voltar
    </a>

    <h1 class="mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Adicionar remédio</h1>

    <form method="post" action="/medicamentos" class="space-y-4 rounded-2xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="{{csrfToken}}">

      <div>
        <label for="nome" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Nome</label>
        <input id="nome" name="nome" type="text" required minlength="2" placeholder="Losartana"
               class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500/20">
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="dosagem" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Dosagem</label>
        <input id="dosagem" name="dosagem" type="text" required placeholder="50 mg — 1 comprimido"
               class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500/20">
      </div>

      <fieldset>
        <legend class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Horários</legend>
        <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-slate-500">Um horário por linha de campo. Deixe em branco os que não usar.</p>
        <div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-4">
          {{#each (range 4)}}
            <input name="horarios[]" type="time"
                   class="rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm tabular-nums focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500/20">
          {{/each}}
        </div>
      </fieldset>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <div>
          <label for="inicioEm" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Início</label>
          <input id="inicioEm" name="inicioEm" type="date" required
                 class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500/20">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label for="fimEm" class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Fim <span class="font-normal text-slate-400">(opcional)</span></label>
          <input id="fimEm" name="fimEm" type="date"
                 class="mt-1 w-full rounded-xl border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-teal-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500/20">
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Sem data de fim, o tratamento é tratado como uso contínuo e os lembretes seguem sendo gerados.</p>

      <button type="submit"
              class="w-full rounded-xl bg-teal-600 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-teal-700 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-teal-600">
        Salvar
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
